    "show_share": true,
    "description": "Professor Zulfiqar A. Bhutta has been honoured with the The World Academy of Sciences 2016 TWAS Prize in medical sciences, in recognition of his \"incisive work on academic paediatrics and public health in Pakistan, which has contributed to shape global child health and policy\".",
